        <description>&lt;h3&gt;Corrected&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**Engine upgrades find verified rollback engines in older preserved apps.** When the most recent app backup already contains the newer engine, Spire also checks numbered bootstrap backups of the same app. Signature and version checks remain mandatory, unrelated and symlinked backups are excluded, and the archived license comes from the selected predecessor bundle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item>
