        <description>&lt;h3&gt;Corrected&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**Computer Use can read and navigate the System telemetry screen.** The telemetry layout avoids a grouping structure that crashed OpenAI&amp;#x27;s accessibility reader, while keeping metric values, sample age, and unavailable-data messages visible. Verified with local and remote System-to-Benchmark navigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item>
