                <enclosure url="https://github.com/Truth-Forge/spire-releases/releases/download/v1.7.10-352/Spire346-340.delta" sparkle:deltaFrom="340" length="4864582" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleExecutableSize="977808" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleLocales="de,he,ar,el,ja,fa,uk" sparkle:edSignature="KAd4qjRLHgPEdEa42WN15B7+OL4o9cbOJIbbKsj81nQzXVyeeMXP61Wp1JlOeg+1lGTLKPZ5hOe5hNGm+FQHDQ==" />
                <enclosure url="https://github.com/Truth-Forge/spire-releases/releases/download/v1.7.10-352/Spire346-337.delta" sparkle:deltaFrom="337" length="5695726" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleExecutableSize="977808" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleLocales="de,he,ar,el,ja,fa,uk" sparkle:edSignature="Aqbr1Q48aUS2y0vsD0OxiL4JtOr6iaoNk/nWBvzNZX+zI6DKb4UcxB0wAeRDxEJfaNrJJN0Tie5AhBGhh5nZDw==" />
            </sparkle:deltas>
        <description>&lt;h3&gt;Corrected&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**Remote model maintenance can finish its verification and upgrade checks.** Deep verification and engine requalification now receive a one-hour request budget, preserving longer configured budgets. Ordinary fleet status requests retain their shorter deadline. Model integrity checks, candidate admission, and rollback requirements remain enforced.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**Hermes setup shows its current stage and identifies missing conversation evidence.** Progress distinguishes container startup from agent qualification. A qualification failure names the missing tool call, result, reasoning, or final response instead of implying every part of the conversation failed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item>
